    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="Ne8d78977619b4191a30e7951629a01ed"/>
    <cde:source>local</cde:source>
    <cde:sourceStatus>unrequested</cde:sourceStatus>
    <cde:designNote>No request filed. It is a nodule, and the mural part is already carried by COMPONENT_OF: a nodule that is a component of a cyst is a mural nodule. Asking for the pre-coordinated term would duplicate what the graph already says.</cde:designNote>
