    <cde:conceptSource>Fleischner Society</cde:conceptSource>
    <cde:sourceDefinition>Consolidation refers to an exudate or other product of disease that replaces alveolar air, rendering the lung solid (as in infective pneumonia). Radiographs and CT scans.—[Fleischner Society]</cde:sourceDefinition>
  </rdf:Description>
