  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://radelement.org/ng/mayRepresent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Inverse of mayManifestAs. How a report reads: finding toward conclusion.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://radelement.org/ng/mayManifestAs"/>
    <cde:epistemic rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</cde:epistemic>
    <cde:inferenceBearing rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</cde:inferenceBearing>
    <cde:designNote>Inferential reading, one edge. It covers direct appearances and indirect signs alike, and carries no formal semantics, so no reasoner check uses it. Marked epistemic and inferenceBearing false so that is explicit rather than assumed. </cde:designNote>
  </rdf:Description>
