    <cde:conceptSource>BI-RADS 5; PI-RADS 2, TI-RADS</cde:conceptSource>
    <cde:sourceDefinition>PI-RADS:  uneven.  BI-RADS MRI:  Uneven or jagged edges (but not spiculated).  TI-RADS: without clear soft tissue protrusions into the parenchyma.
